            <div xml:id="d538">

                <pb facs="0541" n="532" xml:id="pg532"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">611.2231/284: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Minister in Ecuador</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic">Long</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic"
                        >to the Secretary of State</hi></head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Quito</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1938-08-08T16:00:00-05:00">August 8, 1938—4
                        p.m.</date><lb/>[Received 7 p.m.]</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>97. Department’s telegram No. 46, August 8, 10 a.m. and my telegram No. 95,
                    August 8, 1 [<hi rendition="#italic">5?</hi>] p.m. Exchange of notes now
                    completed both bearing date August 6th. Executive decree is expected to be
                    signed shortly: will advise.</p>
                <p>Because Ministries have ceased administrative functions it is believed further
                    changes could not be made.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Long</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
